// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`personal schedule > renders the real empty schedule state 1`] = `"<section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-shell-view="schedule"><div class="page-stack schedule-page"><header class="schedule-header"><div class="schedule-heading"><span class="schedule-kicker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg>日程安排</span><h2>个人日程</h2><p>让 CrewON 按计划完成重复工作，并把结果留在这里。</p></div><div class="schedule-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search schedule-search"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input aria-label="搜索日程" placeholder="搜索日程或执行记录" value=""/></label><button class="icon-action schedule-refresh" type="button" disabled="" aria-label="刷新日程" title="刷新日程"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg></button><button class="button primary" type="button" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>新建日程</button></div></header><nav class="schedule-subnav" aria-label="日程筛选"><div class="schedule-scope-tabs" role="group" aria-label="日程范围"><button class="active" type="button">个人日程</button><button class="" type="button">小队日程</button></div><span class="schedule-nav-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="schedule-view-tabs" role="group" aria-label="查看内容"><button class="active" type="button">日程</button><button class="" type="button">执行记录</button></div><span class="schedule-delivery-note"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-inbox"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg>结果发送给：我（创建者） · 保存在个人日程中心</span></nav><section class="schedule-summary" aria-label="日程概览"><article><span>已启用</span><strong>0</strong><small>按计划自动执行</small></article><article><span>执行中</span><strong>0</strong><small>同一日程不会重叠</small></article><article><span>失败</span><strong>0</strong><small>可在记录中追踪</small></article><article><span>下一次执行</span><strong class="schedule-next-run">—</strong><small>到时自动开始执行</small></article></section><div class="schedule-alert" role="status">App Server 未连接，连接后可管理个人日程。</div><section class="schedule-task-list" aria-label="个人日程列表"><div class="schedule-empty"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg><h3>还没有个人日程</h3><p>创建后，CrewON 会按计划自动执行；即使关闭浏览器，安排仍然保留。</p><button class="button primary" type="button" disabled="">创建第一个日程</button></div></section></div><div class="modal-backdrop" hidden="" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="schedule-create-title"><form class="arrangement-modal-card schedule-create-modal"><header class="arrangement-modal-header"><div><h2 id="schedule-create-title">新建个人日程</h2><p>CrewON 会按你的安排自动执行，并将结果发送给你。</p></div><button class="icon-action compact" type="button" aria-label="关闭"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></header><label class="form-field"><span>日程名称</span><input required="" value="每日项目进展摘要"/></label><label class="form-field"><span>要完成什么</span><textarea required="" rows="4">汇总项目进展、关键变化、阻塞和需要我确认的事项，并给出下一步建议。</textarea></label><fieldset class="schedule-frequency"><legend>执行频率</legend><button class="active" type="button">每天</button><button class="" type="button">每周</button><button class="" type="button">按间隔</button><button class="" type="button">单次</button></fieldset><div class="schedule-time-fields"><label class="form-field"><span>执行时间</span><input type="time" required="" value="18:00"/></label></div><section class="schedule-delivery"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-inbox"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg><div><strong>结果发送给：我（创建者）</strong><span>保存在个人日程中心和专属结果线程，可从执行记录随时查看。</span></div></section><footer class="arrangement-modal-actions"><button class="button" type="button">取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg>创建并启用</button></footer></form></div></section>"`;
